// name :
"P1641399726" "Dirge of Chaos"
// requiresfailedtext :
"P2251523409" "You must be a member of the Midnighter Club to access this mission."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RaveQA 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2384620731" "Raver Tip"
// DetailString :
"P3452652713" ""The rave's DJ had this to say:<br><br><color lightseagreen>This is insanity, man. These freaks just barged in and pushed me out of the DJ booth. Then this local punk show organizer named Amanda Gates came in and hooked up some shabby old cassette player to the sound system. The moment she pressed play everyone just went completely insane. It was pandemonium. I must have blacked out for a bit 'cause when I came to the music had stopped, and so had the fighting. Most of the freaks stuck around, but Amanda and the cassette player were gone."</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MagicCassettePlayerClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3932140517" "Magic Cassette Player"
// DetailString :
"P2848179713" "One of the Freakshow told you that they're working with a woman from Talos Island named <color red>Amanda Gates</color>. He said she has a <color deepskyblue>magic cassette player</color> that amps him up harder than Excelsior."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3918870477" "The Dirge of Chaos"
// DetailString :
"P2942810364" "Mercedes Sheldon sent you to check out a Troll Rave in Skyway City that was crashed by the Freakshow. When you arrived the place was overrun by freaks brawling with the trolls and holding a handful of ravers hostage. You beat down the freaks, rescued the hostages, and questioned everyone involved.<br><br>You discovered that the Freakshow were working with a punk show organizer from Talos Island named <color red>Amanda Gates</color>, and in her possession was a magic cassette player that apparently drove people into a rage.<br><br>Ms. Sheldon informed you that her suspicions had been confirmed. The magic cassette player was in fact an artifact that was stolen from her called <color red>the Dirge of Chaos</color>. She explained that it needed to be recovered before more damage was done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - FreakshowHideoutClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P50131042" "Freakshow Hideout"
// DetailString :
"P2734972055" "The last freak finally ponies up the info you've been looking for. Amanda Gates is holed up with a freak named <color red>Killdozer</color> at his hideout here on Talos Island. He gives you the address and then promptly passes out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AmandaIsGoneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2417472336" "Amanda Is Gone"
// DetailString :
"P3895270054" "Killdozer told you that Amanda Gates has already left to destroy the city and there is nothing you can do to stop her. Before you can coerce him to tell you where she went his vocal amplifier shorts out rendering him mute. You'd better look around for some clues."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HideoutClue1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2761966814" "Punk Show Flyer"
// DetailString :
"P4145396994" "This flyer is for a punk show called 'Tear down the walls'. <color orange>Amanda Gates' name appears on the flyer as the show coordinator</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HideoutClue2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3283455798" "Radio Station Webpage"
// DetailString :
"P3254038312" "Once roused from hibernation mode, the laptop's browser is currently open to the <color orange>WNRK Radio Station webpage</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HideoutClue3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2541107843" "Printed Out Map of Talos Island"
// DetailString :
"P3364104512" "In the trash can you find a crumpled up print out of a map of Talos Island. <color orange>Several locations are circled with Xs through all but one</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HideoutClue4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2384781856" "White Board Plan"
// DetailString :
"P1183965822" "On the white board you see a simple bullet point plan that goes something like this. <color orange>1.) Raid the station 2.) Hook up the tape player to the broadcast antennae 3.) Rock Paragon City into rubble.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AnarchyRadioClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P952901538" "WNRK 'Anarchy' Radio"
// DetailString :
"P3981481936" "You put together the clues and realize that <color orange>Amanda Gates and the Freakshow are heading to the WNRK 'Anarchy' Radio Station here on Talos Island</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3262346704" "Mercedes Sheldon sent you to check out a Troll Rave in Skyway City that was crashed by the Freakshow. When you arrived the place was overrun by freaks brawling with the trolls and holding a handful of ravers hostage. You beat down the freaks, rescued the hostages, and questioned everyone involved.<br><br>You discovered that the Freakshow were working with a punk show organizer from Talos Island named <color red>Amanda Gates</color>, and in her possession was a magic cassette player that apparently drove people into a rage.<br><br>Ms. Sheldon informed you that her suspicions had been confirmed. The magic cassette player was in fact an artifact that was stolen from her called <color red>the Dirge of Chaos</color>. She explained that it needed to be recovered before more damage was done.<br><br>You hit the streets and questioned the Freakshow on Talos Island about Amanda Gates' whereabouts. You learned that she was holed up in a Freakshow hideout run by a freak named <color red>Killdozer</color>.<br><br> Busting into the hideout you found that you were too late to catch Amanda, but you discovered enough clues to realize that she was taking the Dirge of Chaos to <color deepskyblue>WNRK 'Anarchy' Radio</color> and planned to broadcast the music to all of Paragon City."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AmandaCapturedClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P719723475" "Amanda Gates in Custody!"
// DetailString :
"P3115954662" "You're glad Amanda Gates doesn't have any powers beyond being in a perpetually foul mood. With her cassette tape ruined and the daemons driven off, Amanda grudgingly gives herself up to the authorities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DirgeRecoveredClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4282051309" "The Dirge is Recovered"
// DetailString :
"P3543443149" "The Dirge of Chaos, a shabby looking cassette player in its current incarnation, shudders with rage in your hands. Without a tape to play, the artifact is powerless, and you can sense the evil within is not at all happy about its recent defeat at your hands."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - DirgeOfChaosSouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// tDetailString :
"P974412803" "As you you look over the ruined cassette tape you took from Amanda Gates you're reminded of the events you've come to know as <color deepskyblue>The Dirge of Chaos.</color><br><br>Mercedes Sheldon sent you to check out a Troll Rave in Skyway City that was crashed by the Freakshow. When you arrived the place was overrun by freaks brawling with the trolls and holding a handful of ravers hostage. You beat down the freaks, rescued the hostages, and questioned everyone involved.<br><br>You discovered that the Freakshow were working with a punk show organizer from Talos Island named <color red>Amanda Gates</color>, and in her possession was a magic cassette player that apparently drove people into a rage.<br><br>Ms. Sheldon informed you that her suspicions had been confirmed. The magic cassette player was in fact an artifact that was stolen from her called <color red>the Dirge of Chaos</color>. She explained that it needed to be recovered before more damage was done.<br><br>You hit the streets and questioned the Freakshow on Talos Island about Amanda Gates' whereabouts. You learned that she was holed up in a Freakshow hideout run by a freak named <color red>Killdozer</color>.<br><br> Busting into the hideout you found that you were too late to catch Amanda, but you discovered enough clues to realize that she was taking the Dirge of Chaos to <color deepskyblue>WNRK 'Anarchy' Radio</color> and planned to broadcast the music to all of Paragon City.<br><br>Without a moment to lose, you raced over to WNRK 'Anarchy' Radio, battled through the Freakshow, and ultimately defeated the Dirge of Chaos and it's daemonic minions, taking Amanda Gates into custody.<br><br>With the Dirge of Chaos safely back in the hands of Mercedes Sheldon and the Midnight Squad you realized just how close Paragon City came to annihilation. But thanks to your efforts, the city was saved."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P647486889" "{HeroName}, I've heard all about you. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance. But enough with the pleasantries, let's get down to business, shall we?<br><br>A troll rave in Skyway City just exploded into unimaginable violence, more so than usual. Even more intriguing is that the Freakshow seem to be involved, if not directly responsible. <color orange>I want you to head over to Skyway City and defeat the Freakshow.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P658863853" "Investigate the Troll Rave in Skyway City."
// SendOffString :
"P1386254228" "Normally such street ruffians are beneath the notice or concern of the Midnight Squad, but I have my reasons for being interested in this particular incident.<br><br>Once the situation is calm you should question everyone. I want to know exactly what happened in there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P891266713" "Investigate The Troll Rave"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1029531152" "Have you determined what transpired at the rave? <color orange>The Freakshow must know something</color>, any scrap of information could prove vitally important."
// TaskTitle :
"P2703557021" "<color deepskyblue>The Dirge of Chaos</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2896349181" "If there are still innocent people in here, you'd better make sure they get to safety."

