// Dialog :
"P2934137944" "You see a simple three step plan detailed on the white board."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3862925473" "You put the clues together and realize that Amanda Gates and the Freakshow must be heading to WNRK 'Anarchy' Radio!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1187052905" "A radio station? In the name of...! {HeroName}, she must be planning to play the Dirge of Chaos over the airwaves!"
// RandomFameString :
"P4216162521" "I heard that {HeroName} is taking the Freakshow down."

