// BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2098973930" "The Dirge of Chaos is a herald of the end times, a daemon tasked with orchestrating the song that will end the world. Through endless centuries it has taken form as a variety of musical instruments, twisting the music of mortals into the strange piping anthems of things that should not be. Never before has the Dirge's ruinous ballad threatened to destroy so many. It must be stopped."

