// Dialog :
"P4291624132" "You've stopped Amanda Gates and saved Paragon City from the Dirge of Chaos."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3579258244" "Great job, {HeroName}! With the Dirge of Chaos safely back in Midnighter hands we can all sleep a little easier.<br><br>The only question that remains to be answered is how did Amanda Gates get her hands on the Dirge of Chaos in the first place? I suspect that she may hold the key to recovering the other artifacts that were stolen from my family. If answers are forthcoming I may call on you sooner than later.<br><br>Thanks, {HeroName}. I don't know what the world would do without you."
// RandomFameString :
"P1031538993" "I heard that {HeroName} challenged a daemon to a rock-off and won!"

